# jarvis-core machine-local environment (copy to .env.local — gitignored).
# This repo is public: no secret VALUES belong anywhere but .env.local.
#
# Most credentials do NOT go here — jarvis-core fetches them at runtime,
# by world (ARCHITECTURE.md §7):
#   CACC     → vault.cacadets.org        (CACC_VAULT_TOKEN, User-scope env var)
#     - "CACC Core / Supabase" / SUPABASE_SUPAVISOR_TRANSACTION_URL  (cacc-checks)
#     - "CACC Core / Vercel"   / VERCEL_TOKEN                        (cacc-checks)
#   Momentum → vault.momentumsystems.dev (MOMENTUM_VAULT_TOKEN, User-scope env var)
#     - "Momentum Core / Supabase" / CRM_DATABASE_URL                (momentum-crm)
#   CACC mailbox → the cached Graph token at ~/.cacc-graph/token.json (cacc-comms)
#
# Personal-world credentials have no vault; they live here instead:

# Andrew OS (tracking.andrewroach.xyz) — personal Supabase project, schema
# `tracking`. Same values as SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY in the
# tracking repo's own .env.local.
TRACKING_SUPABASE_URL=
TRACKING_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# --- Phase 4 pro mode (every one of these is OPTIONAL — a missing key means
# --- that tier fails closed to its free counterpart, with the reason shown
# --- on the core panel's pipeline chips. Never spend silently.)

# Pro-mode reasoning (Claude, used only while the toggle is on "pro").
# The SDK also resolves an `ant auth login` profile if one exists.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# The voice needs no key: it is a local VoiceStudio/OmniVoice clone served on
# 127.0.0.1:3900 (scripts/install-voicestudio.ps1 + scripts/build-jarvis-voice.ps1),
# configured in jarvis.config.json under voice.voicestudio.

# "Good morning" briefing music (ducked AC/DC on the active Spotify device).
# Human setup: create an app at developer.spotify.com, run an OAuth
# authorization-code flow once with scopes user-modify-playback-state +
# user-read-playback-state, and paste the refresh token here. Missing values
# skip the music, never the briefing.
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=
SPOTIFY_REFRESH_TOKEN=
